wait is operation
wait purpose "Wait once for something, when what the caller waits for is not there yet: 2 when the task is cancelled (and the wait is cancellable), 1 when the deadline has passed, otherwise 0 after other tasks ran or time passed, and the caller looks again"
wait invariant waitsOnce "\"Gives 2 for a cancelled task in a cancellable wait, else 1 past the deadline, else 0 once the task may go on; traps when no task can ever go on\""
wait typeParameter none
wait input what String borrowed
wait input deadline Int64 copied
wait input cancellable Int64 copied
wait input external machine.Address copied
wait output Int64
wait outputOwnedBy none
wait raises none
wait effect use machine.memory
