channelReceive is operation
channelReceive purpose "channel.Channel.receive: wait until the channel has an item, then take the first; closed (once it is empty), timedOut, or cancelled"
channelReceive invariant receivesItem "\"Gives the items in the order they were sent; a closed, empty channel gives closed\""
channelReceive typeParameter none
channelReceive input shape machine.Address copied
channelReceive input args machine.Address copied
channelReceive input results machine.Address copied
channelReceive input payload machine.Address copied
channelReceive output Int32
